ver-1000-as-her-family-fundraiser-reached-nearly-74000/articleshow/133292637.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T15:26:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133293031,imgsize-1346967.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why Indians moving to the US rush to buy homes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133293168.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Indian immigrants are increasingly able to secure homes in the US soon after their arrival. With appealing mortgage conditions and reduced initial payments, owning a home becomes a realistic goal. The affordability of monthly mortgage payments, often on par with rental costs, encourages investment in real estate. Moreover, strong cultural emphasis on homeownership supports property acquisition as a financial strategy for wealth enhancement.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/why-do-indians-moving-to-the-us-buy-homes-so-soon-an-indian-living-in-america-explains/articleshow/133293168.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/why-do-indians-moving-to-the-us-buy-homes-so-soon-an-indian-living-in-america-explains/articleshow/133293168.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T15:40:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133293256,imgsize-514115.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists found genetically unusual avocados in Nicaragua that may preserve clues of migration]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133290297.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://times